{"id":"00388","root":"uni00388_1","name":{"ja":"弓走　颯","en":"Yubashiri Hayate"},"title":{"ja":"【堅物ハロウィン】","en":"【Straightforward Halloween】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【堅物ハロウィン】 弓走　颯","en":"【Straightforward Halloween】 Yubashiri Hayate"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-10-16","limited":true,"characterId":53,"profile":{"ja":"弓の名門・弓走家の跡取り娘。幼いころから弓の訓練を受けて育ち、その腕はすでに達人の域。目視できる距離ならほぼ１００％の確率で標的に矢を当てることができ、さらに忍術・風遁の力で矢に風を纏わせることにより、弓の軌道を操り、殺傷能力を高めることもできる。厳しく育てられたためか、少し融通が利かず、冗談の通じない性格。本人もどうにかしたいと日々精神鍛錬をしているが、幼少からの性質はなかなか変えられずにいる。ある時、クラスメイトのジョークを真に受けて言い争いになった結果、なぜかハロウィンイベントに参加することになってしまう。自身の未熟さを悔いる颯は「せめてこのイベントを通じて冗談を冗談と流せるように鍛錬しよう！」と決心する。","en":"Yubashiri Hayate is the heir of the prestigious Yumi-hashi archery family. Trained from childhood, her skill already reaches master level. She can hit a visible target with near-perfect accuracy, and by applying wind-style ninjutsu she can cloak her arrows in wind, steering their trajectory and boosting their lethality. Rigid upbringing has left her a bit inflexible and unable to take jokes, a trait she's constantly trying to improve through mental training, though her childhood habits persist. After taking a classmate's joke seriously and getting into an argument, she somehow ends up participating in the Halloween event. Regretting her own immaturity, Hayate resolves, \"At the very least, I'll use this event to train myself to let jokes stay just jokes!\""},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"御苑生メイ","forms":[{"id":"uni00388_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1048,2096],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[144,288],"def":[116,232],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","800007"]},{"id":"uni00388_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1596,3192],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[223,446],"def":[167,334],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","800007","800008"]},{"id":"uni00388_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2144,4298],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[307,615],"def":[223,443],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","800007","800008"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage","tag":"instant"}]},"800007":{"slot":"skill1","id":800007,"name":{"ja":"つ、つまみ食いじゃない！"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"自身のATKを中アップする"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"自身のATKを中アップする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"自身のATKを中アップする"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"自身のATKを中アップする"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"自身のATKを中アップする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Self: ATK +40% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_up","tag":"buff"}]},"800008":{"slot":"skill2","id":800008,"name":{"ja":"風遁・つむじ菓子"},"hits":3,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":260,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力でDEFを無視して攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":260,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力でDEFを無視して攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":260,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力でDEFを無視して攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":260,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力でDEFを無視して攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":260,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力でDEFを無視して攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"3 enemies: 160% Natural damage ignoring 100% DEF","icon":"def_through","tag":"instant"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"恥じらいのハロウィン"},"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ユニットのDEFを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Natural allies: DEF +20%","icon":"def_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00005",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00005",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00005",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00005",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00005",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00005",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00005",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ハ、ハロウィンで仮装をするとは聞いていたが、こんな格好でいいのか？　おい……ニヤニヤ笑うのをやめて、質問に答えろ！","en":"\"Ha, I heard you'd be dressing up for Halloween, but is this okay? Hey… stop grinning and answer my question!\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ほ、ほ～ら子供たち～？　お菓子をあげるから、イタズラはよすんだぞ～？　って、これでいいのかっ？　本当かっ？","en":"\"H-here, kids… I'll give you candy if you stop mischief, okay? Is this right? Really?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"子供というのは、本当にお菓子が好きなものだな。まぁ、私とて甘味は嫌いではないが……ち、違う！　ねだったわけではない！","en":"\"Kids really do love sweets. Well, I'm not opposed to sweets myself… n-no! I'm not doing it because I want them!\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"疲れた身体には、甘みが染み渡るな……慣れないことをすると、疲労も鍛錬の比ではないということか","en":"\"A tired body soaked in sweetness… doing something unfamiliar makes fatigue feel nothing compared to training.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"一つ余ってしまったか……なぁ、その……こ、これはあれだ。一日、私に付き合わせてしまったからな……その礼だ、受け取っておけ","en":"\"Looks like I have an extra… um, this is… because you spent a day with me… consider it a thank-you, take it.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"……今日一日、お菓子を配っていて気づいたことがある。仮装する必要があるのは、お菓子をもらう側ではないか！","en":"\"…After handing out candy all day, I realized something. The ones who need to dress up are the ones receiving the candy, aren't they?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"お菓子ばかり配っていたせいか、私も少し、口にしたくなってきたな……あの店で、少し休んでいかないか","en":"Maybe it's because I've been handing out sweets all day, but I'm starting to want a bite myself… Want to take a little break at that shop?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"よ、よせ、バカぁ……こんな、ところでぇ……んっ……誰かに見られたら、どうするつもりだぁっ……ぁんっ！","en":"S-stop it, you idiot… Not here… *moan*… What are you gonna do if someone sees us… *moan*!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00388_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"わ、私をこんな風にしたんだ、責任を取ってもらうぞっ……ちゃんと、最後まで……気持ちよくしろっ、いいなっ？","en":"You made me like this, so you'll take responsibility… Make sure you keep me feeling good right to the end, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00388_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00388_1/uni00388_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","